#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Invasion"
msgstr "Invasione"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hold out against a giant ant invasion."
msgstr "Resisti all’invasione delle formiche giganti."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "From Mission Control"
msgstr "Dal centro di controllo missione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Eliminate all hostile presence from the region."
msgstr "Elimina tutte le presenze ostili dalla zona."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Your current situation is of utmost concern to us. The satellite has "
"detected an extremely strong enemy presence approaching your spaceship from "
"all directions. Use your best judgment and the quickest, most efficient "
"defense: either <a object|tower>towers</a> or <a object|botfr>shooters</a>."
msgstr ""
"La tua situazione ci preoccupa molto. Il satellite ha rilevato un’enorme "
"forza nemica che si avvicina all’astronave da ogni direzione. Scegli la "
"difesa più rapida ed efficace: <a object|tower>torri</a> o <a "
"object|botfr>robot tiratori</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to increase your survival chances, we have developed a program that"
" will protect your west flank if you execute it on your <a "
"object|botfr>wheeled shooter</a>; see the program page <button 53/>."
msgstr ""
"Per aumentare le tue possibilità di sopravvivenza, abbiamo sviluppato un "
"programma che proteggerà il fianco occidentale se eseguito sul <a "
"object|botfr>robot tiratore su ruote</a>: consulta la pagina dei programmi "
"<button 53/>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times on your personal SatCom <button 63/>."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> ti permette di rileggere queste istruzioni "
"in qualsiasi momento sul tuo SatCom personale <button 63/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10 ../help/soluce.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a> and <a cbot>CBOT Language</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a> e <a cbot>linguaggio CBOT</a>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/report.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite Report"
msgstr "Rapporto satellitare"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently in a geo-stationary orbit of Saari."
msgstr "Attualmente in orbita geostazionaria attorno a Saari."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SURFACE<c/>"
msgstr "-> SUPERFICIE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Temperature:      38.4C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosphere:       CO2, oxygen, nitrogen\n"
"\\tab;Wind:             1.4 mps\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     some\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      none"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Temperatura:      38.4C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosfera:       CO2, ossigeno, azoto\n"
"\\tab;Vento:             1.4 mps\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     presente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      assente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SUBSOIL<c/>"
msgstr "-> SOTTOSUOLO<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Energy source:    everywhere\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     none\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      none"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Fonte di energia:    ovunque\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      assente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<c/>"
msgstr "-> INFORMAZIONI AGGIUNTIVE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Detected:         giant ants approaching \n"
"\\tab;  - Danger:       yes, immediate"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Rilevato:         formiche giganti in avvicinamento \n"
"\\tab;  - Pericolo:       sì, immediato"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Walkthrough"
msgstr "Soluzione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Execute immediately the program <code>KillAnt1</code> on the <a "
"object|botfr>wheeled shooter</a>; it will take care of the first wave of "
"attack coming from west."
msgstr ""
"Esegui subito il programma <code>KillAnt1</code> sul <a object|botfr>robot "
"tiratore su ruote</a>: si occuperà della prima ondata d’attacco da ovest."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then build two <a object|tower>defense towers</a> one in the north of the <a"
" object|base>spaceship</a>, the other one in the south (you have to do this "
"VERY quickly). While <a object|human>you</a> are building, use the <a "
"object|botgr>grabber</a> to get a <a object|power>power cell</a>."
msgstr ""
"Costruisci poi due <a object|tower>torri difensive</a>, una a nord e una a "
"sud dell’<a object|base>astronave</a>. Devi fare MOLTO in fretta. Mentre <a "
"object|human>costruisci</a>, usa il <a object|botgr>robot trasportatore</a> "
"per prendere una <a object|power>batteria</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As soon as the successive waves of attack, made up of about fifteen <a "
"object|ant>ants</a>, are gone, you have time to take care of the ants that "
"did not attack. Build a <a object|radar>radar</a> in order to spot them, and"
" a <a object|convert>converter</a>, a <a object|factory>bot factory</a>, a "
"<a object|station>power station</a> and a <a object|botfj>winged shooter</a>"
" in order to get rid of them..."
msgstr ""
"Quando saranno terminate le ondate d’attacco, composte da circa quindici <a "
"object|ant>formiche</a>, potrai occuparti di quelle rimaste. Costruisci un "
"<a object|radar>radar</a> per individuarle, poi un <a "
"object|convert>convertitore</a>, una <a object|factory>fabbrica di "
"robot</a>, una <a object|station>centrale elettrica</a> e un <a "
"object|botfj>robot tiratore volante</a> per eliminarle..."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a>"
